A very simple Map (Google Map) plugin for developers

== Description ==

This is a very simple map (Google Map) plugin for developers. You get the API Key, the location coordinates and you are almost done with it. 
Add the marker content, choose the default map zoom and the style you want to visualize.
Once you are done, you have just to click to copy the HTML container and paste it wherever you want to display your map.

= Privacy notices =

At present this plugin, in itself, does not:

* track users by stealth;
* write any user personal data to the database;
* send any data to external servers;
* use cookies.


== Installation ==

1. Upload the entire plugin folder to the '/wp-content/plugins/' directory.
1. Activate the plugin through the **Plugins** screen (**Plugins > Installed Plugins**).

You will find **Simple Map** menu in your WordPress admin screen.

For basic usage, have a look at the [plugin's website](https://giuliani.studio/).


